rule: ELIM-G-18
ack is specialized for each literal m; count, an action, is not.
CHECK-DAG: -- specialization of Main.ack(_:Int; _:Int) at 0:Int, _
CHECK-DAG: -- specialization of Main.ack(_:Int; _:Int) at 1:Int, _
CHECK-DAG: -- specialization of Main.ack(_:Int; _:Int) at 2:Int, _
CHECK-DAG: -- specialization of Main.ack(_:Int; _:Int) at 3:Int, _
CHECK-DAG: -- specialization of Main.count(_:Int) .PrimIO.MkIO#0 @(_:%World)
CHECK-NOT: Main.count(_:Int) .PrimIO.MkIO#0 @(_:%World) at
